{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack\/requestprogress"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"requestProgress","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestProgress","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack(im)requestProgress","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requestProgress"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Request an asynchronous update to the pack’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" properties."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/requestProgress"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestProgress","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The state and progress of an inactive or completed pack are computed lazily. If"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you need the state or progress of a pack whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" property is currently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", observe KVO change notifications on this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pack’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" key path, then call this method. Alternatively, you can add an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"observer for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" about this pack that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"come from the default notification center."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Posted by the shared "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" object when an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object’s progress changes. The progress may change due to a resource being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded or because the pack discovers during the download that more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resources are required for offline viewing. This notification is posted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whenever any field in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" property changes."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackprogresschangednotification"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePack/requestProgress":{"role":"symbol","title":"requestProgress","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestProgress","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Request an asynchronous update to the pack’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" properties."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/requestProgress","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack\/requestprogress","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePack":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","type":"topic","title":"MLNOfflinePack","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepack","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" represents a collection of resources necessary for viewing"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a region offline to a local database.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePack","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNOfflineStorage","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflineStorage"}],"abstract":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage implements a singleton (shared object) that manages offline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"packs and ambient caching. All of this class’s instance methods are asynchronous,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reflecting the fact that offline resources are stored in a database. The shared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object maintains a canonical collection of offline packs in its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflinePackState/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown":{"role":"symbol","title":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"It is unknown whether the pack is inactive, active, or complete.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackstate\/mlnofflinepackstateunknown","kind":"symbol"}}}